{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://ebmr.internal/contracts/events/event-ebmr-005.json",
  "title": "SPEC-EBMR-005 — Review-by-Exception & QA Review Events",
  "description": "Document 113 event contract for the events app/modules/qa_review/commands.py actually emits. 4 of the catalogue's 6 declared Document 14 events are implemented: QAReviewPackageCreated, QAExceptionIndexed, QAReviewReopened, QAReviewCompleted (QAExceptionIndexed doubles as the re-index-on-reopen event when the package does not transition to REOPENED). QAReviewStarted and QAActionRequested are declared in 07_EVENT_CATALOGUE.yaml but have no producing code path -- review-package creation goes straight to indexed/completed state without a separate \"started\"/\"action requested\" step in this build; verified directly against source, not assumed.",
  "x-requirement-ids": [
    "RBE-FR-001",
    "RBE-FR-002",
    "RBE-FR-003",
    "RBE-FR-004",
    "RBE-FR-005",
    "RBE-FR-006",
    "RBE-FR-007",
    "RBE-FR-008"
  ],
